>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Site-by-site g-xTB correction of ligand connectivity. The original same-ID connection table supports the corrected ligand skeleton. Site-specific g-xTB bond orders, distances and explicit valences support this connectivity; Formal charges follow the source representation of the same composition and balance the total charge. Localized 42 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

