>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. Retain one N,O ligand, one conventional acetylacetonate and one C₅O₂ fragment bearing H4. The O–C–C region of the latter shows consecutive multiple bonds and a distinct Ru–C contact; Use a neutral cumulene limiting form. The other two ligands each carry −1, Balances Ru(II). Localized 6 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths.

